  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-008 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah, and Urgot. Version 0.10.9 restores Urgot W to a pure data-driven self-cast: one cancelable and movable 240-tick parent owns twelve direct auto-target Purge rounds, with no Rust channel state, target handle, native cancel hook, per-shot marker, SwitchByBuff, or attack lock. AI promotes W only from a legal engine-selected attack target and checks R first. Urgot E retains the first reviewed rush-behind and flip contract. The real 30px match scoreboard now uses the same approved head-and-shoulders crop and scale as the correct 40px battle sidebar portrait. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
